{"schemaVersion":1,"generatedAt":"2026-08-16T04:39:29.844Z","sourceLatestModifiedAt":"2026-07-16T04:02:18.338181+00:00","missionGeneration":{"generationId":"09845999a73432800e773946","missionSchemaVersion":3,"sourceContractVersion":4,"offerSchemaVersion":1,"offerJoinStatus":"joined_exact_variant"},"missionId":"b420cb29-8e79-4965-ba20-78047e8fd265","mission":{"missionId":"b420cb29-8e79-4965-ba20-78047e8fd265","title":"QV Breaker Station Mining Rights (Exclusive)","description":"CONTRACT: Mining Rights Transfer\nLOCATION: Nyx\n\nDETAILS:\nShubin Interstellar prospectors have recently discovered the location of an abandoned QV Planetary Service Breaker Station near the Keeger belt. These stations were originally used by the defunct company to harvest valuable resources from inside asteroids but knowledge of their exact locations has been lost over the years. \n\nWhile this particular station is offline, our scout team believes that it could be made functional again with the necessary repairs. Additionally, if it was brought back online, there's already a resource-heavy asteroid in place ready to be cracked by the station's mining laser. \n\nUnfortunately, with all the various challenges that come with operating in Nyx, Shubin doesn't currently have the available bandwidth to handle the aforementioned repairs ourselves. This however has created an opportunity for an interested independent mining operation such as yourself. \n\n<EM4>TERMS*: </EM4>\nWe are making available the <EM4>exclusive mining rights</EM4> to this QV Breaker Station. Upon purchase, we will provide the coordinates of the station to only you and your crew. Your team will then be free to head there with a <EM4>mining vessel</EM4>, restore the <EM4>station's mining laser</EM4> to an operational status, crack the asteroid, and <EM4>harvest the resources</EM4> inside. \n\nPlease note that while we guarantee that these coordinates will be exclusive to you, we cannot assure that other interested parties, such as outlaws, may not discover the station's location on their own. Caution is advised. \n\n*By accepting this contract you are assuming any and all risks associated with the work outlined herein and in no way can Shubin Interstellar be held accountable for any damages accrued during the duration of the contract.","factionName":"Unknown Faction","missionType":"Contract Generator Handler List","category":"Contract","missionGiver":"Shubin Interstellar","prerequisites":["Contract Prerequisite Location - locationAvailable: 17092f34-d9c8-4d50-89f6-a92940b9cd52","Contract Prerequisite Reputation - includePrerequisiteWhenSharing: 0, factionReputation: e4527dd7-f0eb-4342-afe8-5ded1fe428df, scope: d31bd373-35ab-4ea4-b0a7-0ccc867ef082, exclude: 0, minStanding: fab8e959-132a-4fa8-a83e-92c42492438d, maxStanding: 426da095-27b1-4ac3-8722-af57a973c79c"],"rewardPools":["RDC Exclusive"],"rewards":[{"rewardKey":"c14689b3-71ba-4386-be4a-9ed558d97d4b","blueprintGuid":"c14689b3-71ba-4386-be4a-9ed558d97d4b","displayName":"Monde Arms Delta Camo","componentType":"armor","blueprintName":"CraftingBlueprintRecord.BP_CRAFT_kap_combat_heavy_arms_02_07_01","poolGuid":"1e31d7e8-3033-4c98-a477-c474810d48c1","poolName":"RDC Exclusive","poolChance":0.09090909090909091,"rewardChance":1,"chance":0.09090909090909091,"weight":1},{"rewardKey":"4db9360f-dd3e-4aff-8ada-f79897951cae","blueprintGuid":"4db9360f-dd3e-4aff-8ada-f79897951cae","displayName":"Monde Arms Hemlock Camo","componentType":"armor","blueprintName":"CraftingBlueprintRecord.BP_CRAFT_kap_combat_heavy_arms_02_04_01","poolGuid":"1e31d7e8-3033-4c98-a477-c474810d48c1","poolName":"RDC Exclusive","poolChance":0.09090909090909091,"rewardChance":1,"chance":0.09090909090909091,"weight":1},{"rewardKey":"19bf2ec3-f114-4f27-982f-5236b35fe8c7","blueprintGuid":"19bf2ec3-f114-4f27-982f-5236b35fe8c7","displayName":"Monde Core Delta Camo","componentType":"armor","blueprintName":"CraftingBlueprintRecord.BP_CRAFT_kap_combat_heavy_core_02_07_01","poolGuid":"1e3